This repository is an independent port of Tencent HY-World 2.0 to AMD GPUs
(ROCm / HIP, Linux and Windows) and Apple Silicon (Metal / MPS), with a local
web interface and export tooling. It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Tencent. The provider of this software is Vladimir Talyzin.

Upstream: https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-World-2.0
Weights:  https://huggingface.co/tencent/HY-World-2.0 (downloaded by the end
          user with download_weights.py; no weights are redistributed here)

The directory HY-World-2.0/ contains the upstream source tree at commit
df9988efb87bfc0f4947eb3889411cf957478b06 ("Fix citation", 2026-08-13) with
the modifications listed below. The upstream README media (assets/) and demo
inputs (examples/) are not included.

