Statement of modifications to the upstream work
-----------------------------------------------
(Section 3(b) of the Tencent licence: modified files carry this notice.)

Modified upstream files:

  .gitignore
      ignore the hipify mirror and generated host shims of the gsplat build.
  hyworld2/__init__.py
      import hyworld2.compat first so the ROCm/MPS runtime settings apply to
      every entry point.
  hyworld2/panogen/pipeline_with_qwen_image.py
      put the repo root on sys.path and load the compat layer; select the
      device through compat; enable decode-only VAE tiling and the
      Conv3d -> Conv2d fold on non-CUDA backends; synchronise after each
      denoising step so the progress bar is honest; make CPU offload opt-in.
  hyworld2/worldrecon/pipeline.py
      guard the torch.distributed / FSDP imports; use compat.autocast and
      compat.preferred_dtype instead of hardcoded CUDA/bf16; resolve local
      weight directories; synchronise any non-CPU device (not only CUDA)
      before reading the inference timer; drain the device before the
      interpreter exits; timing and logging tweaks.
  hyworld2/worldrecon/hyworldmirror/models/layers/attention.py
      route attention through hyworld2/compat/attention.py (FlashAttention on
      CUDA, scaled_dot_product_attention elsewhere).
  hyworld2/worldrecon/hyworldmirror/models/models/rasterization.py
      soft-import gsplat; a descriptive error only if rasterization is called.
  hyworld2/worldrecon/hyworldmirror/models/models/visual_transformer.py
      quote a torch._C._distributed_c10d annotation; compat.autocast.
  hyworld2/worldrecon/hyworldmirror/models/models/worldmirror.py
      compat.autocast and compat.preferred_dtype for the input casts.
  hyworld2/worldrecon/hyworldmirror/utils/render_utils.py
      guard dist.is_initialized() with dist.is_available().
  hyworld2/worldrecon/gradio_app.py
      device selection through compat.
  hyworld2/worldgen/video_gen.py, traj_render.py, gen_gs_data.py
      sys.path bootstrap and compat import; skip device-mesh construction on a
      single rank; single-process stand-ins for torch.distributed.
  hyworld2/worldgen/src/general_utils.py
      soft-import decord with an OpenCV fallback for get_last_video_frame.
  hyworld2/worldgen/src/sp_utils/parallel_states.py
      skip the device mesh when there is no distributed backend.
  hyworld2/worldgen/models/worldstereo_wrapper.py
      guard the FSDP import; build the transformer on the meta device and
      stream the checkpoint tensor by tensor; load the text encoder in the
      backend's half dtype; skip torch.compile where Triton is absent;
      unroll the Wan VAE's causal Conv3d into Conv2d passes on ROCm.
  hyworld2/worldgen/models/dmd_scheduler.py
      device selection through compat.
  hyworld2/worldgen/third_party/gsplat_maskgaussian/setup.py
      HIP build: correct ROCM_HOME with the rocm-sdk wheels, clang-compatible
      flags, device-bitcode path, glm/rocThrust/hipCUB include paths, .cu
      shims so host sources go through hipcc on Windows.
  hyworld2/worldgen/third_party/gsplat_maskgaussian/gsplat/cuda/include/Utils.cuh
      cooperative-groups shims (warp reductions, labeled_partition) under
      USE_ROCM; hipcub namespace alias.
  hyworld2/worldgen/third_party/gsplat_maskgaussian/gsplat/cuda/include/Cameras.cuh
      std::array::at() -> operator[] in device code.
  hyworld2/worldgen/third_party/gsplat_maskgaussian/gsplat/cuda/csrc/*.cu
      explicit (const void *) casts for hipFuncSetAttribute.
  hyworld2/worldgen/third_party/gsplat_maskgaussian/gsplat/distributed.py
      soft-import torch.distributed.nn.

